<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車トンネル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花覗き込み.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "明かされた真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>At that my face did stiffen.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What this meant was that <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had put a curse on me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"H-Hahaha...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That's right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! The person trying to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is sitting right beside you!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That's the face you ought to be making after all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had never seen <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> with a face like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her bloodshot eyes were open wide, and she was grinning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had to compare it to something, then...
{PAUSE ""}
it was the face of a witch.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> really are a fool...! You came along knowing I'm a killer, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You trusted me and came this far, didn't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Just how much of a flower garden have you got inside your head...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hahahahaha-he-hahahaha-he-hahaha...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Th-That's not true! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hasn't done anything like that!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Heh-hahahahahaha!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So what are you going to do!?</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Riding a train like this, there's nowhere to run!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Natsumi!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　You are going to die!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　You are going to die today...!!</STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　HA-HA-HE-HA-HA-HA-HA-HI-A-HA-HA...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is not <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, turned into a witch...?<PG>
No! I will not be pushed back!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> is only confused and deranged by now, and does not know what to do anymore!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I absolutely must not <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ひ">back</STYLE> away one single step!<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would never kill me...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Because... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has been my best friend since the day I was born...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For an instant the words 'a friendship that was never real' came into my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I did not think a line as cheap as that would get through to her.<PG>
But, to give in here is something I absolutely must not do.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, still with the face of a "witch," went on staring at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To a thing like that, I will not lose.<PG>
But,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
From <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s wept-out eyes, tears flowed again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車汽笛.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumiii</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't want you to die... Don't die, please..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> raised a desperate cry and spilled more tears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was proof better than anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> has no murderous intent. All she has is the delusion that she is a witch, and a paper figure.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... calm down."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I reached out a hand to rub <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't touch me!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I have no right to be comforted by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No! Right now I absolutely must not accept what <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> is claiming.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm staying with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. And she's not going to kill me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... but this morning, actually―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't insult me. A trick like that, I will clear away for you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm a witch! Why are you staying with me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It was </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> who told me to stay with her, wasn't it!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, that's right! I thought that if I sent </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> somewhere far away it would be all right!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But then I realized that if I was with you it was no good after all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What you're saying is nonsense now! And </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s curse is bound to be just as much nonsense, just as slapdash!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's not slapdash! Every one of them I have cursed so far has died!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"There is no way I would believe a story like that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Shut up, shut up, shut up!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　What would </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> know about me!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> are no friend of mine anymore!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ビンタ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花ビンタされる.gal" "NORMAL" "12" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKESTOP "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
My open palm struck <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s cheek.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s hair clip came loose, and her bangs fell across her face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I had ever hit anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hand, with <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s tears on it, was <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE>, and it hurt more than I had imagined.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... What? What you just said. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Not friends anymore?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Come on, say it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I said, say it again!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">　That we're not friends anymore!?"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's not it...! I didn't seriously...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hah, unbelievable, saying a thing like that on impulse... What does </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> want? What do you intend to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know... I don't know...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then what am I supposed to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What! You cry and you apologize, you say you don't want me to die, and yet that's all there is!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Why won't you say that you will save me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Save you...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If it were the other way around, whatever happened I would protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and show you I could. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Or did you mean it, that word about not being friends?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"O-Of course that's not so! I... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then save me! Protect me from the curse </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> laid!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">save..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I can't hear you. Say it more clearly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I will... save </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from the shinigami."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing those words, I could finally let the tension out of my shoulders.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah. If the shinigami appears, save me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Please. Right now </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is the only one I can rely on."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"All right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Thank you. But I still can't believe in </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s curse. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Even so, a 'shinigami' who has killed six people may exist. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What sort of thing is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At my question, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> took one deep breath.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The shinigami always kills the one who was cursed. In a horribly cruel, terrible way...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> knows about it too, doesn't she? The Megasawa City murders..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... I know about it."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"When I lay a curse, the Megasawa City murders happen on April 8 without fail. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">With no exception at all, when I lay a curse, the one I cursed always dies on April 8..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Surely the culprit in the Megasawa City murders is... that shinigami?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right... That's why it can kill in ways no human could... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm a witch and I called the shinigami up, so I know what the shinigami really is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, by <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s logic, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> is the principal and the shinigami is the one who carried it out.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> knew what the shinigami really was―in other words the identity of a violent criminal, and stayed silent all this time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why had the police never tracked him down?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The shinigami must be a human being inside anyway, and a spiriting-away sort of method must be some kind of trick.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Perhaps <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> knows about the method as well.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What the shinigami really is, I'll tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and no one else. It will surely appear in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What the shinigami really is...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">it's my dad."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\電車汽笛.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "200"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車トンネル.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Huh? The whistle just now, I could not hear her properly...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I couldn't hear you properly..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's my dad...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad is the shinigami?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad, who is supposed to be overseas?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s dad come all the way back to Japan for this day?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry for keeping quiet about it until now, but my dad died a long time ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When I lay a curse, he appears on April 8, the anniversary of his death, and my wish―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">he kills the one I cursed, for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's precisely because he's a dead man that a crime like a spiriting-away is possible."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad was dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A confession that ought to have been enormous was, by now, no more than one piece of information.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, that a dead man was the culprit was not something I could believe straight away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Have you ever met </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s dad now that he has become the shinigami?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I have never met my dad as the shinigami either, so I don't really know what he looks like... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... when I was living in Megasawa City, I heard a rumor... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Apparently there was someone who saw just a tiny glimpse of the moment of the crime..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which meant that they were at least not killed by something invisible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"My dad... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="なた">Nata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and mace, that is, a metal </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="こんぼう">club</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">: that is what he kills with, they say.</STYLE> [TN: a nata is a heavy single-edged Japanese billhook]
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And..."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"He wears a Noh mask."</STYLE> [TN: Noh is classical Japanese theater whose actors wear carved wooden masks]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"A Noh mask? You mean one of those masks?"</STYLE>
